<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσ-αυλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσσ-</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτ-</span></b> : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>): <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσσαυλος, ὁ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσσαυλον,
			τό</span> (gender unknown), prob. <i>the inner court, inside
				the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>, where cattle were put at
			night, <i><span class="en">
				11.11.548
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.112
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				657
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.29
			</span></i>; used of the cave of the Cyclops, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.435
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Att.
			 Prose and Com. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέταυλος</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>), ἡ, <i>the door between the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>
			<i>and the inner part of the house</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				371
			</span></i>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέταυλος θύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					1.17
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύραι μέσαυλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					549
				</span></i>
			; <i>mesauloe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				6.7.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
